        "Security News",
        "Threat Intelligence",
        "CERT/CC",
        "Vulnerability"
      ],
      "title": "VU#529388: Privilege escalation vulnerability via unprotected IOCTL interface in Pegatron Tdelo64.sys",
      "url": "https://blog.secopsai.dev/posts/news-3d2e7f8fefa18de1-vu-529388-privilege-escalation-vulnerability-via-unprotected-ioctl-i.html"
